    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a45">

                <pb facs="0573" n="523" xml:id="pg523"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 45.—From Lisbon to Buenos
                        Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-26"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 26,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’affaires of
                    Portugal:</hi></p>
                <p>Please transmit to Commander Castilho:</p>
                <p>The refugees about whom there is no dispute remain on the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mindello</hi>, the rest going in the <hi rendition="#italic">Pedro
                    III</hi>, conveyed by the corvette <hi rendition="#italic">Alfonso de
                        Albuquerque</hi> until beyond anger, when the corvette will return there and
                    the fugitives will be transferred from the <hi rendition="#italic">Mindello</hi>
                    to it. I ask definite instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Neves Ferreira.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
